@*
  RLogistics API — auth + full surface.
  Mode: Authentication:Mode = Jwt | ApiKey | JwtAndApiKey
*@
@RLogistics = http://localhost:5088
@token = paste-jwt-here

### Auth schemes (public)
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/auth/schemes

### Issue JWT (lab password from appsettings)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coord1@demo.local",
  "password": "Demo@RLogistics2026!"
}

### Who am I (JWT)
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List requests (JWT)
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List vendors (API Key — coordinator)
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/vendors
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-coord-key-change-me

### Create (user JWT or key)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contactName": "Alex Requestor",
  "contactEmail": "user@demo.local",
  "site": "API Site",
  "pickupAddressLine1": "1 Main",
  "pickupCity": "Charlotte",
  "dispositionType": "Sanitize",
  "requestType": "UsSurplus",
  "assets": [
    { "assetType": "Laptop", "manufacturer": "Dell", "model": "5540", "quantity": 1, "deviceGuid": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee" }
  ]
}

### Partner plan + quotes (coord)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/requests/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-coord-key-change-me

{
  "transportVendorId": 1,
  "processingVendorId": 3,
  "scheduledPickupDate": "2026-08-20",
  "scheduledPickupSlot": "08:00–12:00 (Morning)",
  "markPickupScheduled": true,
  "expectedDeviceReturnDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### Vendor quotes
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/requests/1/vendor-quotes
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-coord-key-change-me

### Admin templates
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/admin/email-templates
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me

### Notifications status (Mock | PersonalMicrosoft | EnterpriseGraph)
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/notifications/status
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me

### Start Graph device-code login (admin; poll status for code)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/notifications/graph/login
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me

### Test email (Mock or Graph depending on Mode)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/notifications/test-email
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me

{
  "to": "you@outlook.com"
}

### Test Teams (MockOutbox | IncomingWebhook | Graph)
POST {{RLogistics}}/api/notifications/test-teams
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me

### Teams outbox API
GET {{RLogistics}}/api/notifications/teams-outbox
X-Api-Key: rlogistics-demo-admin-key-change-me
